{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113234511335-1113_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261113234511\"/><p>巴士失控墮河。</p><p>巴基斯坦一輛巴士周四（12日）晚在北部吉爾吉特-伯爾蒂斯坦地區墮河，造成至少11人死亡、兩人受傷。巴士從首府吉爾吉特前往吉澤爾地區，途中失控墮河。救援人員找到多具遇難者遺體，包括兩名婦女和一名嬰兒。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:03:42.942901+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:45:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T15:57:14.002010+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:57:14.002010+00:00","content_hash":"1640d2863f7b36359c314ea87eaa5ae5ca558a260463b14f7e141ce01d7f44f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}